  "description": "A pnpjs-style fluent SharePoint client for .NET. One site speaks three APIs — the classic REST API, the Graph endpoints it also hosts, and the client object model — and this is all three, plus one curated layer over them that routes each operation to whichever does it best. Chaining builds URLs; nothing is sent until you await.",
